// expect: E0208
// A misspelt sink (known-gaps round G3, BUGS.md BUG-086). BROKEN on purpose.
//
// `sqlQeury` is not `sqlQuery`. No taint pass can see a sink it cannot
// name, so before name resolution this program passed `aether check`
// with no E0713 and exit 0, then died with a Python NameError at `run`.
// Now the misspelling is E0208 (a reference to an undeclared name), with
// `sqlQuery` as the suggestion. Fix the spelling and E0713 fires on the
// string-built query instead: bind the value with `sqlBind`.
//
// E0208 is name resolution, not type checking: it proves the name refers
// to some binding, never that the binding has the right type.

function findUser(name: String) returns Unit
  effects db.query
do
  sqlQeury("SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '" + name + "'")
end

function main() returns Unit
  effects db.query
do
  findUser("alice")
end
